WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.992
Detective Smith was at his nephew's birthday party.

2
00:00:05.993 --> 00:00:07.837
A man was performing.

3
00:00:07.838 --> 00:00:10.921
"My name is Chuck," the man said.

4
00:00:10.922 --> 00:00:13.273
He moved a large doll on his lap.

5
00:00:13.274 --> 00:00:16.554
"And this is Chuckles. Say hello, Chuckles."

6
00:00:16.555 --> 00:00:18.398
"Hello, Chuckles."

7
00:00:18.399 --> 00:00:21.202
Chuck tried to pretend that Chuckles was talking.

8
00:00:21.203 --> 00:00:24.564
"Your mouth is moving!" a girl said.

9
00:00:24.565 --> 00:00:27.573
"This show stinks," a boy said.

10
00:00:27.574 --> 00:00:31.205
Chuck kept talking. "You're not good at this, Chuck.

11
00:00:31.206 --> 00:00:33.653
That's not nice, Chuckles.

12
00:00:33.654 --> 00:00:39.360
No, I'm not nice, Chuck. I'm bad, bad, bad!"

13
00:00:39.361 --> 00:00:45.261
Detective Smith groaned. "This is terrible."

14
00:00:45.262 --> 00:00:49.292
"I don't know what to get for Dina," Mara said.

15
00:00:49.293 --> 00:00:52.089
*** Roxy and her friends were at Downtown

16
00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:54.717
Toys. It was the biggest toy store in Metro

17
00:00:54.718 --> 00:00:56.890
City. Mara needed a gift for her

18
00:00:56.891 --> 00:00:59.537
cousin. "How old is Dina?" Roxy

19
00:00:59.538 --> 00:01:03.301
asked. "She's two years old," Mara

20
00:01:03.302 --> 00:01:05.700
said. "Hmm," Terrell

21
00:01:05.701 --> 00:01:08.370
said. "I wonder what two-year-olds like to

22
00:01:08.371 --> 00:01:12.093
do." Jack grabbed a plastic sword. "Does Dina like

23
00:01:12.094 --> 00:01:14.057
swords?" Jack swung the sword

24
00:01:14.058 --> 00:01:16.019
around. Then he pretended to fight

25
00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:18.332
Terrell. Terrell laughed and grabbed a

26
00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:22.375
sword. Bonk! Bang! He and Jack knocked the swords

27
00:01:22.376 --> 00:01:24.997
together. Roxy and Mara rolled their

28
00:01:24.998 --> 00:01:28.019
eyes. "Dina is lots of fun," Mara

29
00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:29.993
said. "I love playing with

30
00:01:29.994 --> 00:01:33.652
her. But I don't know what she does when I'm not around."

31
00:01:33.653 --> 00:01:36.772
"You can get her an art kit," Roxy said.

32
00:01:36.773 --> 00:01:41.732
She picked one up. "This has pencils, brushes, and paint."

33
00:01:41.733 --> 00:01:45.330
Mara shook her head. "That's too messy.

34
00:01:45.331 --> 00:01:50.955
The last time Dina came over, she smeared ketchup all over the table.

35
00:01:50.956 --> 00:01:55.787
I don't think she should have paint."

36
00:01:55.788 --> 00:01:59.607
"This store sells musical instruments," Roxy said.

37
00:01:59.608 --> 00:02:03.413
"You could get Dina a recorder or some drums."

38
00:02:03.414 --> 00:02:09.373
Mara snorted. "No way! Dina is loud enough already!"

39
00:02:09.374 --> 00:02:12.735
"Oof!" Terrell fell backward into Roxy.

40
00:02:12.736 --> 00:02:17.374
"Sorry!" Terrell said. "Jack knocked me over."

41
00:02:17.375 --> 00:02:21.970
Jack swung his sword. Terrell blocked it.

42
00:02:21.971 --> 00:02:27.610
Roxy laughed. "It's too bad Rocket Girl isn't here, Terrell."

43
00:02:27.611 --> 00:02:29.597
"Why?" Terrell asked.

44
00:02:29.598 --> 00:02:33.700
Roxy smiled. "She could help you defeat Jack!"

45
00:02:33.701 --> 00:02:36.055
"No way!" Jack said.

46
00:02:36.056 --> 00:02:38.321
"Even Rocket Girl can't defeat me.

47
00:02:38.322 --> 00:02:41.725
I'm Sir Jack, the bravest knight in the land!"

48
00:02:41.726 --> 00:02:45.061
"Ha!" Terrell leaped toward Jack with his sword.

49
00:02:45.062 --> 00:02:50.006
Roxy grabbed a sword, but then her watch beeped.

50
00:02:50.007 --> 00:02:56.276
She stepped away from her friends.

51
00:02:56.277 --> 00:03:00.169
"Mayor Bloom?" Roxy said. "What's wrong?"

52
00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:02.604
"Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

53
00:03:02.605 --> 00:03:06.041
"I need you to go to Metro City Convention Center.

54
00:03:06.042 --> 00:03:08.510
There's a huge doll show this weekend.

55
00:03:08.511 --> 00:03:12.352
Someone stole some very valuable dolls."

56
00:03:12.353 --> 00:03:14.594
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

57
00:03:14.595 --> 00:03:18.972
"Rocket Girl is on her way!"

